msgctxt "10\t184"
msgid ""
"Her name was Haruka.\\n"
"She was just 9 years old."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "211\t373"
msgid ""
"She had come to the city by herself to\\n"
"look for her mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "385\t570"
msgid ""
"Our meeting was coincidental,\\n"
"but we did have one thing in common."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "583\t654"
msgid "What are you going to do now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720\t875"
msgid "My mother and Yumi are all I have..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "917\t943"
msgid "Yumi...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "962\t1100"
msgid ""
"This girl who was searching for her\\n"
"mother also knew Yumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1153\t1353"
msgid ""
"Maybe it was fate that brought us together.\\n"
"She and I proceeded to find the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1443\t1464"
msgid "However..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1589\t1671"
msgid "That's the girl we're lookin' for."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1672\t1692"
msgid "Wha⑬?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1698\t1907"
msgid ""
"The Tojo Clan believed Haruka was the\\n"
"key to the missing 10 billion yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1946\t1998"
msgid "We were on the run day after day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2018\t2153"
msgid ""
"I did my best to protect Haruka while\\n"
"looking for Yumi and the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2301\t2456"
msgid "It was then that we met a detective."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2509\t2620"
msgid ""
"Makoto Date.\\n"
"Formerly of Investigations Division 1."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2649\t2832"
msgid ""
"His investigation of me had twisted\\n"
"his outlook on life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2840\t2997"
msgid ""
"And now he had come to ask for my help\\n"
"in getting his career back on track."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3061\t3250"
msgid ""
"I'm investigating Chairman Sera's murder.\\n"
"Help me out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3700\t3822"
msgid "An ex<Sign:22>yakuza and a detective."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4115\t4215"
msgid ""
"We had been brought together by a strange\\n"
"twist of fate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4239\t4351"
msgid "And eventually, we became friends."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4421\t4452"
msgid "However..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4530\t4683"
msgid ""
"Kazuma Kiryu!\\n"
"You're under arrest for kidnapping!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4717\t4842"
msgid ""
"Police Chief Sudo had made it his personal\\n"
"mission to find Haruka and me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4843\t4874"
msgid "Date!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4896\t4940"
msgid "Sorry I'm late."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4941\t5003"
msgid "Are you sure you want to do this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5062\t5093"
msgid "Let's get out of here, Kazuma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5190\t5284"
msgid "Date was caught between us and the police⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5310\t5370"
msgid "⑬and he chose us."
msgstr ""